POCKETSMART AI

Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

Phase 8: Project Demonstration

1. Demonstration Objective

The objective of the demonstration is to show the completed PocketSmart AI project, explain its purpose and features, and demonstrate how the system works from input to final output.

2. Demo Video Structure

The demonstration video should contain the following sections:

Part 1: Project Introduction

Introduce the project:

Project Name: PocketSmart AI
Project Title: Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

Briefly explain that the project helps users track income and expenses, manage their budget, analyze spending, and receive recommendations.

Part 2: Problem Statement

Explain the problem:

Users may find it difficult to track their daily expenses and understand their spending patterns. This can make budget management difficult.

Part 3: Project Purpose

Explain that PocketSmart AI is designed to make personal budget management easier by organizing financial information and providing spending recommendations.

Part 4: Features

Demonstrate the main features:

- Income entry
- Expense entry
- Expense categorization
- Budget setting
- Balance calculation
- Spending analysis
- AI recommendations
- Dashboard/results

Part 5: Live Execution

Show the project running on the screen.

Example:

Income: ₹20,000

Food Expense: ₹3,000

Travel Expense: ₹2,000

Other Expenses: ₹2,000

Total Expenses: ₹7,000

Remaining Balance: ₹13,000

Then show how the system analyzes the information and provides recommendations.

Part 6: Working Process

Explain the flow:

User Input

↓

Data Processing

↓

Expense Calculation

↓

Spending Analysis

↓

AI Recommendation

↓

Final Output

Part 7: Benefits

Explain that the system can help users:

- Track spending.
- Understand their expenses.
- Monitor their budget.
- Identify high-spending areas.
- Receive useful recommendations.

Part 8: Final Output

Show the final dashboard/results clearly.

Explain the important information displayed by the system.

Part 9: Conclusion

End the demonstration by briefly explaining the overall purpose and expected usefulness of PocketSmart AI.

3. Demo Video Requirements

The video should include:

- Screen recording
- Voice-over
- Project name
- Project purpose
- Project uses and benefits
- Project execution/working process
- Final output

4. Video Submission

After recording the demonstration:

1. Upload the video to Google Drive.
2. Change the sharing permission so that the required viewers can access it.
3. Copy the Google Drive sharing link.
4. Verify the link using another browser/account if possible.
5. Submit the link according to the SmartBridge instructions.

5. Final Project Submission Checklist

Before submission, verify:

